                <div class="productDesk">
                    <h1 class="marginBottom20 ColorRed">Azo Pigment Red</h1>
                    <p>Azo Pigment Red Pigment, also known as Pigment Red 149 (PR149) (or depending on your specific product classification, it might also include PR190 or others), is a high-performance organic pigment renowned for its bright, intense red shade, excellent weather fastness, and chemical stability. It is part of the phthalocyanine pigment family, synthesized through complex processes involving phthalic anhydride, urea, copper salts, and catalysts, ensuring consistent quality and performance.</p>
                    <p>This pigment is available in different crystal modifications offering various shades and performance characteristics suitable for multiple industrial applications. Its consistent color strength and dispersibility make it a preferred choice across coatings, plastics, and printing industries.</p>
