                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i><span>Masterbatches:</span> For efficient plastic coloring and uniform dispersion</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i><span>High-speed dispersers or mills:</span> For paints, coatings, and inks to achieve uniform particle distribution</li>
